      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10051",
      "speaker": "yuno",
      "text": "ウワモノが増えて、音楽的にやれることが広がった。 それがアレンジとして面白いって思っただけ",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_yumemita_003_1_12/adv_voice_yumemita_003_1_12_056.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_yumemita_003_1_12/adv_script_yumemita_003_1_12-Episode/adv_script_yumemita_003_1_12-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
