      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_yumemita_003_1_12_056.wav",
      "subtitle": "旋律声部变丰富了，音乐上能做的事情也变多了。\n我只是觉得这在编曲上很有趣而已",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "ebe89c36385448c56a4c3c60806c517d530dd33185d06888028315c6f77170d0",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_yumemita_003_1_12/adv_script_yumemita_003_1_12-Text/adv_script_yumemita_003_1_12-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_yumemita_003_1_18_151",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10057",
      "speaker": "yuno",
      "text": "ありえない。実際体育なんてなくても困らなくない？ 生きてるだけで体力使ってるんだし",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_yumemita_003_1_18/adv_voice_yumemita_003_1_18_151.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_yumemita_003_1_18/adv_script_yumemita_003_1_18-Episode/adv_script_yumemita_003_1_18-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "a52b63f65a11904032a3d5ed51c25141da67dd8c47b44d47f05d42a7f18c03b4",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_yumemita_003_1_18_151.wav",
      "subtitle": "太离谱了。实际上，就算没有体育课也不会觉得困扰吧？\n毕竟光活着就已经在消耗体力了",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "91665835750b415345d75bce49b204b9e705e4261a877b58de642bfc486e8896",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_yumemita_003_1_18/adv_script_yumemita_003_1_18-Text/adv_script_yumemita_003_1_18-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_yumemita_003_1_18_157",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10057",
      "speaker": "yuno",
      "text": "人間は急激に動くようにできてない。 体育やるなら一週間くらい前から心の準備しとかないと",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_yumemita_003_1_18/adv_voice_yumemita_003_1_18_157.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_yumemita_003_1_18/adv_script_yumemita_003_1_18-Episode/adv_script_yumemita_003_1_18-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "8c90bf3dfbc9cd67418365575e0311d5af5b94558c1c81a88abce11e4df88a27",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_yumemita_003_1_18_157.wav",
      "subtitle": "人不是能突然动起来的生物。\n上体育课的话，得提前一周左右做好心理准备",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "eec24b17c31d899a15123c4d7effcd58ac25efc2bd3666529df0bb936bf3eb77",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_yumemita_003_1_18/adv_script_yumemita_003_1_18-Text/adv_script_yumemita_003_1_18-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_yumemita_003_exstory_1_01_043",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10106",
      "speaker": "yuno",
      "text": "１０時３４分、最寄り駅到着。 １０時４７分、水族館到着。 １０時５８分、チケットを購入――",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_yumemita_003_exstory_1_01/adv_voice_yumemita_003_exstory_1_01_043.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_yumemita_003_exstory_1_01/adv_script_yumemita_003_exstory_1_01-Episode/adv_script_yumemita_003_exstory_1_01-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "b3ed4b899a53dee76c0f365f4c202dd52a21bcb20925137fe4e255f13b655aab",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_yumemita_003_exstory_1_01_043.wav",
      "subtitle": "10点34分，到达最近车站。\n10点47分，到达水族馆。\n10点58分，买票——",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "6969abab054997ed004e83432acf1f01cc10a21f94cb76bbde8550bdba89a6fe",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_yumemita_003_exstory_1_01/adv_script_yumemita_003_exstory_1_01-Text/adv_script_yumemita_003_exstory_1_01-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
