      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_yumemita_003_exstory_1_02",
      "speaker": "yuno",
      "text": "……ちょっと待って、なんか断面からサンドイッチじゃ 見たことない具材が覗いてる",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_yumemita_003_exstory_1_02/adv_voice_yumemita_003_exstory_1_02_071.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_yumemita_003_exstory_1_02/adv_script_yumemita_003_exstory_1_02-Episode/adv_script_yumemita_003_exstory_1_02-Episode.json.br",
