      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_yumemita_003_exstory_1_02_071.wav",
      "subtitle": "……等等，从切面看，好像有三明治里没见过的食材",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "1828b171ea117eafdc787bff0e87b96a8db6c101e7a9a6cf22347322676adb71",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_yumemita_003_exstory_1_02/adv_script_yumemita_003_exstory_1_02-Text/adv_script_yumemita_003_exstory_1_02-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
